{"header":{"capture_vectors":{"checked":36,"mismatches":0},"counts":{"contracts":72,"seams":52},"day_basis":"CME trade date; its session opens 18:00 ET on the previous calendar day","purpose":"Q-SFCLEAR-2 G4 roll-date list for the replay window; calendar only (no price, bar or trade data)","residuals":["rule-generated dates (Joshua 2026-10-12); the capture covers listed 2026-2028 contracts only, so historical contracts rest on the same rule","D19 is secondary provenance (date membership only); capture rows after its coverage end use the federal and Good Friday rules alone","no capture vector falls on Columbus Day, Veterans Day or Juneteenth; in the window Juneteenth moves the June 2023 6J last trade and seam and the June 2024 and June 2025 MYM seams (D19 has CME open, early close, on each Juneteenth, so a CME-open-day count would put those seams one session later)","seams follow OPEN-11 by rule; the canonical panels' switch evidence is matched by name, not by hash","MYM June 2026: the 3rd Friday (2026-06-19) is Juneteenth, not a B1 business day (D19: CME open, early close); S4 applies the cited rule as written, and the switch (2026-06-16) is the same under B1 and under CME-open-day counting; a holiday-adjusted last trading day would move it to 2026-06-15"],"rules":["B1 business day (roll dates and seams only; G0 unchanged): a weekday that is not a US federal holiday (5 U.S.C. 6103, Juneteenth from 2021; observed Saturday->Friday and Sunday->Monday, except that a Saturday New Year's Day is not observed on the Friday before), not Good Friday (Gregorian Easter - 2 days) and not a D19 FULL_CLOSURE for the product's group (MGC metals, 6J fx, MYM equity_index)","C1 MGC (even months): first notice = last business day of the month before the contract month; last trade = third-last business day of the contract month","C2 6J (quarterly and serial months; no first notice): last trade = second business day before the third Wednesday of the contract month","C3 contracts listed: every one whose G4 window intersects the replay window","G4 window: from the start (18:00 ET open of its session) of the business day before min(first notice, last trade), through last trade","S1 seams (OPEN-11, feed-equivalence spec 16.2/16.4): the panel switches to the next contract of its cycle at the 18:00 ET open of the session whose CME trade date is the switch date (opens the previous calendar day)","S2 6J: cycle Mar/Jun/Sep/Dec; switch date = 1 business day before last trade","S3 MGC: cycle Feb/Apr/Jun/Aug/Dec (October never selected); switch date = 1 business day before first notice","S4 MYM: cycle Mar/Jun/Sep/Dec; last trading day = the 3rd Friday of the contract month (CME contract specification, 'Trading terminates at 9:30 a.m. ET on the 3rd Friday of the contract month', as recorded in docs/spec/2026-09-27-cme-execution-feed-equivalence-test-DRAFT.md 16.2, read 2026-10-04; applied as written, with no holiday adjustment); switch date = 3 business days before it","S5 seams listed: every switch whose trade date lies in the replay window"],"schema":"sfclear_roll_dates/v1","sources":[{"path":"ops/calendars/cme_holiday_calendar_2022_2026.json","sha256":"2698f2688cce582b08df58516fd770fa4a71a18de04870d9c14511731ea181e9"},{"path":"lab/analysis/c1/sfclear_2026-10/schedule/sources/cme_calendar_capture_20261012.tsv","sha256":"1afbcd9fe42b5237466837ed95e67a477ebb4a3b47812e8fc3b7fdc9e287efa6"}],"window":["2022-09-01","2026-09-02"]},
